* Union of letters used = {a,b,c,d,g,l,o,t,u,w}
* All five exemplars avoid e,m,p,r. The five quoted negatives ear cop ego mom ate all break that avoidance, e.g. contain e,m,p or r, and/or are not CVC.

That e,m,p,r-free CVC description is the cleanest discriminator that separates the two quoted lists.

On that description the five test items behave as

